{'symbol': 'WAT', 'date': '2019-09-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'Creoptix AG announced that it has received CHF 8 million in funding from Swisscanto (Lu) Equity Funds Management Company S.A., Waters Corporation, and other investors', 'text': 'Creoptix AG announced that it has received CHF 8 million led by new investor, Swisscanto (LU) Equity Fund - Sustainable Emerging Markets, a fund managed by Swisscanto (Lu) Equity Funds Management Company S.A. in a round of funding on September 30, 2019. The transaction also included participation from returning investor, Waters Corporation (NYSE:WAT) and other existing private investors. Robert Schier of Swisscanto (Lu) Equity Funds Management Company S.A. joined the board of directors of the company as a part of the transaction.'}
